{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301840","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301840","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1230184001:1":{"text":"아뇨. 제 낚시 솜씨는 아버지만 못해요. 하지만 이번 항해로 돈을 짭짤하게 벌었죠! 가족을 위해 쓰기에 충분해요!","source_cn":"不，我的捕鱼技术可比不过我的父亲。但是这趟航行，我带回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C9440FC52234CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230184002:1":{"text":"하하하, 얘야. 너무 겸손하기만 해도 좋은 건 아니란다.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，孩子，过分谦虚可不是什么好事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7070068EF51B6027","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230184003:1":{"text":"이 이는, 일부러 그렇게 말하는 거 모르겠어?","source_cn":"哎呀，你难道没听出来孩子是故意这么说的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B755A75C3EEBCFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1230184004:1":{"text":"당연히 알지. 아들이 잘 자라서 기분이 너무 좋네!","source_cn":"听出来了，那我也开心！咱们有一个好儿子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7A8BED34F1BE718","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水手普卡德":{"text":"선원 파카드","source":"水手普卡德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老头卡欧":{"text":"캘럼","source":"老头卡欧","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老妇巴福莉":{"text":"노파 베버리","source":"老妇巴福莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count